# Credentials for the paid sweeps only. Nothing else in this repository reads
# them: the pre-flight, the suite, the figure checker, the mutation suite and
# the report all run offline.
#
# PREFERRED: keep keys in ONE private file outside every repository, e.g.
# ~/.secrets/ai.env (chmod 600), and point ENV_FILE at it per run:
#     ENV_FILE=~/.secrets/ai.env .venv/bin/python scripts/sweep.py --provider anthropic
#     ENV_FILE=~/.secrets/ai.env .venv/bin/python scripts/sweep.py --provider openai
#
# ALTERNATIVE: cp .env.example .env and fill it in. scripts/sweep.py reads
# ./.env when ENV_FILE is unset. .env is ignored by git; never commit it.
#
# A key set in the environment itself is used before either file.

# Required only for the matching --provider:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
